# Expected CSP hashes for the stable VitePress inline scripts.
#
# Copy this file to deploy/csp-hashes.txt after the first production build and
# paste the values printed by scripts/deploy-prod.sh, one per line. Lines
# starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Put the same values into the Content-Security-Policy in
# deploy/nginx.seo.lv24.by.conf.example (and the installed vhost), then reload
# nginx. If this file is absent, the deploy script warns and continues.
#
# sha256-<base64 of the theme bootstrap script>=
# sha256-<base64 of the macOS detection script>=
